Z||000000||Jncomutt||09-09-2001||07:23 PM||||Ok.. I did a search on rear sway bars and found the cheapest upgrade I can do for now is to use a front sway bar on the rear.  I am going to put the sway bar on the rear of an 84.   I have a front sway bar from an 86 base coupe I can use.  I need to know what kinda work is involved and some pretty good instructions on how to do it.  Or does someone know a detailed website they can give me the link too.  All information is welcome..  I'm trying to get a good head of what is involved before I started.||||reg||1
